          "Save several files in quick succession. The command runs once for the batch."
        ]
      },
      {
        "feature": "respect .gitignore and .ignore files",
        "title": "Skip files listed in .gitignore and .ignore",
        "steps": [
          "List files to skip in your project's .gitignore.",
          "Run `watchexec --postpone --emit-events-to=environment -- '<command>'` in the project folder.",
          "Changes to ignored files do not trigger the command. Other changes do."
        ]
      },
      {
        "feature": "pass changed paths via environment or STDIN",
        "title": "Pass changed file paths to your command",
        "steps": [
          "Run `watchexec --postpone --emit-events-to=environment -- 'echo $WATCHEXEC_WRITTEN_PATH'` to read the changed path from an environment variable.",
